                    <signifLet xml:id="m-1787d3fa-ffeb-43b1-8543-8f1f5cfe2a0a" /></nc></neume></syllable></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-79e49262-48b7-4e63-8309-5afaa209c508"><lg xml:id="m-308181ad-44bc-4a16-8ae6-a4c46678230c"><l xml:id="m-30dcc194-7c22-4f21-a549-d2143cf71fa6" facs="#m-bfae5b1e-2135-4ddc-9091-201b64de1a16" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-7090e082-c024-4bbe-9b2a-aa2ccf45133b" facs="#m-7d4f58b9-4a49-4534-b946-fed9404b26a0" label="text-like">The Burial Service</l><l xml:id="m-12da19f0-3e41-40fb-9ced-028b4c93a487" facs="#m-ae47bb72-1a38-47eb-b9b2-5e4beb6cf6fc" label="lyrics-like">V. Et ne nos indúcas in tentatiónem. R. Sed libera nos a málo.</l><l xml:id="m-dabda9d5-764d-44e1-8593-32ddbe00e7b8" facs="#m-9b9dfb12-5e6a-4c18-a790-0d26409a97c7" label="lyrics-like">V. A pórta inferi. F. Erue, Dómine, ánimam éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-40bbf32e-1a34-408f-b5ca-6c077147502e" facs="#m-e2778af5-97d2-4979-88b0-c36809462118" label="lyrics-like">V. Requiéscat in páce. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-8cb2cda5-5ef1-4cad-8917-fcb494a00a7a" facs="#m-c260ec82-bab4-490e-83e6-6b46476fc26e" label="lyrics-like">v. Dómine, exáudi oratiónem méam. R. Et clámor méus ad te véniat</l><l xml:id="m-a7496094-2c96-4bc3-b227-15c23475738a" facs="#m-e6b420ca-74ea-4e20-9936-bddb1787ab1e" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. B. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-626c4c1e-698b-45dc-a1e1-8694bdad5a55" facs="#m-6fa97400-fb12-4cc8-a8be-089a6eadb667" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-3fef92bc-5b92-4c2f-a887-74f8c8170d10" facs="#m-4347d841-89a0-4de5-97f9-c36da14bdce6" label="lyrics-like">HIAC, quaésumus Dómine, hanc hic eum (eam) vera fides iunxit fidé¬</l><l xml:id="m-5df2d0cd-a5fd-4588-a64c-1ce1cdbf9d0f" facs="#m-e3f3ebf3-5347-40dd-b104-196ca30a38c8" label="lyrics-like">cum servo tuo defúncto (ancilla</l><l xml:id="m-7dcb40ab-83b6-4eb6-9942-9353d6a64814" facs="#m-9f9be623-5270-43bf-9d9d-2c6744ce02cd" label="ambiguous">lium turmis:* ita illic eum (eam)</l><l xml:id="m-ea555aea-ab96-4bbe-8cae-01411aa3dbbc" facs="#m-95d63803-d68e-4dfd-b90e-605aef46980d" label="lyrics-like">tua defúncta) misericórdiam, ut fa¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba1fe202-3f8d-4d46-9c88-4eccfb626b2a" facs="#m-598c78ee-89eb-4c97-9437-3eb7730a1026" label="lyrics-like">tua miserátio sóciet angélicis cho¬</l><l xml:id="m-aaf3bd67-09e3-4515-a893-4e7a0df80f3e" facs="#m-b2908aef-6552-4075-a60b-d00c11d20044" label="lyrics-like">ris. Per Christum Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-194ed28f-8b50-4ee9-b841-5797563b2890" facs="#m-7dd51b39-d140-4d1e-89c6-a069f571dd0b" label="lyrics-like">ctórum suórum in poenis non recí¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9f29dd3-6d04-43c4-81b6-070de39ca541" facs="#m-932b4320-7db2-48f4-aae5-fd545aa8a5ff" label="ambiguous">piat vicem, qui (quae) tuam in</l><l xml:id="m-ce9af27d-5236-45bb-8f61-7236aed9fa33" facs="#m-c4b31d87-b655-48e4-ae59-2bbe19d2c1d5" label="ambiguous">strum. H. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-3a300679-7d94-4f6d-a5f3-20f0f3361306" facs="#m-2c98f124-bf26-41ad-8ce3-630b2f83a06f" label="lyrics-like">votis ténuit voluntátem:t ut sicut</l><l xml:id="m-4a2fec09-95f8-440c-8e65-0f9836fc96d0" facs="#m-cd112b86-da16-4029-a9e2-1559b5329d08" label="lyrics-like">V. Réquiem aetérnam dóna éi, Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-a45bef88-bb97-4e67-b570-50ba5a73e705" facs="#m-251a0082-194a-4825-9b6f-bb8f6756e754" label="lyrics-like">R. Et lux perpétua lúceat ei.</l><l xml:id="m-7ab9fb40-e86c-4ff8-848c-10114b8c8e01" facs="#m-d3bb48f3-33d1-485c-8ff9-f639035ffd27" label="text-like">The Cantors.</l><l xml:id="m-c590165b-a41c-4e77-9813-7658acff30b3" facs="#m-b8886dff-c071-49f4-a4e0-dda104616f21" label="text-like">The Priest.</l><l xml:id="m-d1deb75b-4034-4779-b7e5-712a260231dc" facs="#m-fd2b3c6e-e205-4613-b6ac-bc4befcd2834" label="lyrics-like">V. Requi-éscat in pá-ce. W. Amen. V. Anima éjus et áni¬</l><l xml:id="m-381f6f15-97a3-4028-8ef7-704318d02c43" facs="#m-695052b6-0db4-42c0-9e5b-41c79f29ce86" label="lyrics-like">mae ómni-um fidé-li-um de-functórum, per mi-se-ricórdi-am</l><l xml:id="m-7ff1943b-42ed-49fb-a3e9-f346f4406d57" facs="#m-030b7871-666f-4bd1-af1f-af32b69265c6" label="lyrics-like">Dé-i requi-éscant in pâce. W. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-c52442b7-8480-4d04-a6b9-b26109419b34" facs="#m-31af401f-214b-40f2-b4e2-43a532d5c007" label="text-like">On the war back to the church or returning to the sacristy, the Ant. Si</l><l xml:id="m-5dced3fb-2c6e-443f-ad0c-2dc2d8e4d4bb" facs="#m-90358b3a-ae8b-4b2a-b1d3-e27a95543928" label="lyrics-like">iniquitátes. and the Psalm De profúndis. are recited, but not sung. At the</l><l xml:id="m-6f900f64-3126-4940-b4ba-00ad0235d836" facs="#m-4b8b222e-c9ba-4f33-8bf7-fc26c389708e" label="lyrics-like">end of the psalm. Réquiem aetérnam. is sd a on p.1763. The Antiphon</l><l xml:id="m-83d1afb7-a275-4372-8a5c-6aaa27a23f9e" facs="#m-c5076002-f024-48ce-b763-fa6e52233dcd" label="lyrics-like">si iniquitátes. is repeated, and the Priest then says the followins prayers:</l><l xml:id="m-d2a2ab56-c247-4c8f-8f34-bf367a750755" facs="#m-cf2952e0-bee6-4315-9b2f-d20c69dfbd87" label="lyrics-like">Kyrie, eléison. Christe, eléison. Kyrie, eléison.</l><l xml:id="m-6da34347-1294-499f-90ff-ea1678efb701" facs="#m-fdbbbbe6-e338-4f3b-8088-5918c6286c61" label="lyrics-like">Páter nóster. continued in silence.</l><l xml:id="m-34b0f483-d0c8-416b-90e5-0c82e9dfeb3f" facs="#m-32d33610-51ea-402f-8cec-0d6ff0a1505b" label="lyrics-like">V. Et ne nos indúcas in tentatiónem. R. Sed libera nos a málo.</l><l xml:id="m-ab9755e3-574b-4d00-9e26-cc917ef59104" facs="#m-b54a14dd-027c-455e-a456-76c72ba62cbd" label="lyrics-like">V. A pórta inferi. R. Erue, Dómine, ánimas eórum.</l><l xml:id="m-b22dfbce-a027-4e93-824f-2ca741446aeb" facs="#m-f798d646-ef72-49aa-ac5a-27b6a59e6c30" label="lyrics-like">V. Requiéscant in páce. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-419400d8-828f-4146-a76b-1255f778082e" facs="#m-f6bb6994-d02e-42a0-97fe-9b75783dce33" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómine, exáudi oratiónem méam. B. Et clámor méus ad te véniat.</l><l xml:id="m-8a88d7ae-863b-4b45-9a40-efaf939415c7" facs="#m-a8b3ad5f-312c-4cf2-bf96-c48f94a9bbf3" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobíscum. E. Et cum spíritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-30236b71-23bc-43e6-aa8e-4eaceb13ee9d" facs="#m-f3f2df53-77b6-46fc-a633-9d0e18f32ff1" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-343eaea8-bcff-42c7-97b5-95652145eb46" facs="#m-b5e83f20-1a84-4be5-b5d2-8a4e908fc07a" label="lyrics-like">LIdélium, Deus, ómnium cónditor! per optavérunt, piis supplicatióni¬</l><l xml:id="m-7811595d-7aa6-4d7b-9b34-4c79cc2efc61" facs="#m-8be6d2b2-be2b-4093-87eb-f83c74fa41a7" label="lyrics-like">et redémptor, animábus famu¬</l><l xml:id="m-567da8b8-d4ec-4d25-b4b4-d6ab88542a5d" facs="#m-106227cd-9c32-438c-b88b-f4ed578139db" label="lyrics-like">bus consequántur: Qui vivis et</l><l xml:id="m-1d27ce95-8951-4d1a-bd62-71f63708f4fa" facs="#m-0249e634-d4ee-4425-bcb7-33a33b988f0a" label="lyrics-like">lórum famularúmque tuárum remis¬</l><l xml:id="m-9d8cb7f6-4cca-4040-893b-cd85dec34fc1" facs="#m-c51c568a-8d5d-4079-be9c-e68267ec83a6" label="lyrics-like">regnas in saécula saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-d20ec358-240c-482a-99d7-e6576654e507" facs="#m-ce536d20-b619-49a4-b6a1-e0b2820160cf" label="lyrics-like">siónem cunctórum tribue peccató¬</l><l xml:id="m-34112795-07d3-4af1-a38d-d784ab78b493" facs="#m-accb0e08-ccc8-492a-8dad-8c92952aea14" label="ambiguous">K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-4e7a5baa-3cdd-4fdf-aea0-953a4890dbe7" facs="#m-e41e68fa-479f-4550-b957-7aaca5715ef3" label="lyrics-like">rum: ut indulgéntiam, quam sem¬</l><l xml:id="m-8383429f-073c-4b74-8c75-24aff24ba4df" facs="#m-3672a2b1-cab9-426b-9c08-d5b442989de9" label="lyrics-like">v. Réquiem aetérnam dóna éis, Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-b3ac3f21-20d8-470d-bd86-643f291abfa5" facs="#m-33ff780e-d479-4d7c-b474-75823d6bc0c7" label="lyrics-like">R. Et lux perpétua lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-440eb422-296e-4da3-a912-8c69c19fff9a" facs="#m-2658863d-52e2-44ff-9cb8-ddb663b69730" label="lyrics-like">V. Requiéscant in páce. I. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-7392383b-afe6-4a84-a8d0-a63ff937d8b7" facs="#m-ee06b19d-f611-41c0-ad24-595350511fc8" label="ambiguous">N° 801. — 64</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>